        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>0-12月猫咪成长手册</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d9dcc0;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #d9dcc0;\n    padding: 10px 12px 18px 12px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .header .title {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .header .t-outline {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 2px #3a3a2f;\n    text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #b9bd9c;\n  }\n  .header .t-box {\n    background: #2f2f28;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 0;\n    text-shadow: none;\n  }\n  .searchbar {\n    margin: 8px 0 12px auto;\n    width: 130px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid #cfcfc4;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #555;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Cards ---------- */\n  .card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 14px 14px 16px 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .stage-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 2px #4a4a3c;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 2px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #cfd3b0;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-style: italic;\n    padding: 3px 10px;\n    color: #2f2f28;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #eeeee6;\n    border: 1px dashed #a9a99a;\n    color: #6a6a5c;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .cap {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n  /* top-right photo */\n  .photo-tr {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    right: 12px;\n    width: 118px;\n    height: 108px;\n    border: 3px solid #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.25);\n  }\n  /* note paper */\n  .note {\n    position: absolute;\n    background: #fdfdf7;\n    border: 1px solid #dcdcd0;\n    box-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.12);\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    padding: 8px 9px;\n  }\n  .note-1 { top: 148px; right: 12px; width: 128px; }\n  .note-2 { top: 152px; right: 12px; width: 128px; }\n  /* bottom image rows */\n  .bottom-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    gap: 18px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n  .item { }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"title\"><span class=\"t-outline\">0-12月</span><span class=\"t-box\">猫咪成长手册</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"searchbar\">🔍 草莓是只喵</div>\n\n  <!-- ================= CARD 1 : 8-9月龄 ================= -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"photo-tr placeholder\">[Photo: 猫草种子罐 / top-right]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"stage-title\">8-9月龄</div>\n\n    <div class=\"label\">成长事项：</div>\n\n    <div style=\"width:60%;\">\n      <p class=\"body-text\">\n        ①猫咪每天会花大量时间去舔毛，毛发吃进肚子是难免的事。若体内积累了大量毛发还会引发毛球症<br>\n        ②可以试着自己种猫草（小麦种子）性价比高。如果猫咪不吃可以换成猫草片，比化毛膏健康的<br>\n        ③家中如果种了花花草草，那要仔细查一下对猫咪是不是有毒\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"note note-1\">\n      对猫咪有毒的植物：<br>\n      百合、杜鹃、绿萝、雏菊、洋牡丹、大丽花、水仙、夹竹桃、绣球花、常春藤、郁金香、虎皮兰、君子兰、秋水仙、芦荟、富贵竹、铃兰\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-row\">\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:110px;height:78px;\">[Photo: 猫草盆栽 / bottom-left]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">猫草</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:86px;height:78px;\">[Photo: 猫草片瓶 / bottom]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">猫草片</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= CARD 2 : 9-10月龄 ================= -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"photo-tr placeholder\">[Photo: 猫咪与逗猫棒 / top-right]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"stage-title\">9-10月龄</div>\n\n    <div class=\"label\">成长事项：</div>\n\n    <div style=\"width:60%;\">\n      <p class=\"body-text\">\n        ①需要保证猫咪的饮水量，如果猫咪不喜欢喝水可以买一个饮水机试试<br>\n        ②给猫咪丰富的空间，保持心情的愉悦，可以每天花20分钟跟猫咪互动，增进感情<br>\n        ③注意纠正猫咪的不良行为，如咬人等<br>\n        ④多让猫咪运动，并且控制好体重\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"note note-2\">\n      猫咪不喜欢喝水的原因：<br>\n      猫咪的祖先是生活在沙漠地带，基因问题导致猫咪渴觉不敏感。<br>\n      但是不代表猫咪对水需求不高。反之猫咪喝水少容易导致泌尿方面的疾病，所以要多喝水\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-row\">\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:118px;height:88px;\">[Photo: 宠物饮水机 / bottom-left]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">宠物饮水机</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:78px;height:88px;\">[Photo: 逗猫棒 / bottom]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">逗猫棒</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
